cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "phyloacc-workflows"
abstract: >-
  Snakemake workflows for preparing comparative genomic alignment inputs for
  PhyloAcc, from a whole-genome alignment (MAF) through neutral model
  estimation (phyloFit), site- and region-level conservation scoring (phyloP,
  phastCons), and CNEE extraction.
authors:
  - family-names: Thomas
    given-names: Gregg
version: 2.2.0
date-released: "2026-07-21"
repository-code: "https://github.com/phyloacc/phyloacc-workflows"
url: "https://phyloacc.github.io/workflow.html"
